[{"title":"和范景仁王景彝殿中杂题三十八首并次韵 其三十五 天上","author":"梅尧臣","text":"紫微垣里月光飞，玉佩腰间正陆离。\n天上去来知几日，蟠桃结子是归时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66810,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和范景仁王景彝殿中杂题三十八首并次韵 其三十六 明月","author":"梅尧臣","text":"明月已生城上头，小星光灭大星流。\n来朝放榜出宫去，何处残花转入沟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66811,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和范景仁王景彝殿中杂题三十八首并次韵 其三十四 省中","author":"梅尧臣","text":"汉相家人尚苦疑，不言温室树何枝。\n君今坦坦无猜忌，夸说皇居尽入诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66812,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和范景仁王景彝殿中杂题三十八首并次韵 其三十 白牡丹","author":"梅尧臣","text":"白云堆里紫霞心，不与姚黄色斗深。\n閒伴春风有时歇，岂能长在玉阶阴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66813,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和资政侍郎湖亭杂咏绝句十首 其五 苔径","author":"梅尧臣","text":"林间夏雨滋，复有斜阳照。\n绿净不摇风，从教春草笑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66814,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和资政侍郎湖亭杂咏绝句十首 其六 流泉","author":"梅尧臣","text":"石齿嚼寒声，粼粼萦曲处。\n有时浮落英，又过城根去。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66815,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和资政侍郎湖亭杂咏绝句十首 其八 渔艇","author":"梅尧臣","text":"古木刳为舟，野藤牵作缆。\n钓人寒雨中，远望烟蓑暗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66816,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和曹光道咏直庐屏中六鹤","author":"梅尧臣","text":"汉家为瑞双黄鹄，只道飞翻太液池。\n不似云屏六画鹤，帝宫深处有人知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66817,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"咏双杏子其核亦然","author":"梅尧臣","text":"子核成双杏，将寄同心人。\n定栖鸳鸯魄，为物岂无因。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66818,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"始作燕子巾","author":"梅尧臣","text":"裹髻不裹额，自名燕子巾。\n翼覆尾涏涏，谁问巢由人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66819,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"林翠","author":"梅尧臣","text":"郁郁长条抽，林间翠堪剪。\n背岭山气浓，幽人趣不浅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66820,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"泗州观唐氏书","author":"梅尧臣","text":"唐氏能书十载闻，谁教精绝向红裙。\n百金买书蒲葵扇，不必更求王右军。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66821,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宣司理饷蒸鹅","author":"梅尧臣","text":"昔年相国笼之赠，今日参军饟以蒸。\n一咀肥甘酬短句，定应无复谤言兴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66822,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"将解舟走笔呈表臣","author":"梅尧臣","text":"昨夜讴吟泻春酒，今朝波浪下黄河。\n主人不暇匆匆别，为倩流莺寄语过。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66823,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春雨","author":"梅尧臣","text":"春雨??鸣百舌，林花淡淡洗燕脂。\n眼前耳底催人杀，不醉三杯大是痴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66824,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"昨于发运马御史求海味马已归阙吴正仲忽分饷黄鱼鲎酱鲚子因成短韵","author":"梅尧臣","text":"前欲淮南求海物，缄书未发报还台。\n陆机黄耳何时至，罂品分传事按杯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66825,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"绝句五首 其五","author":"梅尧臣","text":"虾蟆嚎沫为科斗，蜾裸衔虫化细腰。\n蠹穴荒陂有多少，乾风湿雨各飞跳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66826,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"绝句五首 其四","author":"梅尧臣","text":"葑田青仄博弈局，岛树墨榅烟雨图。\n已去扬州百馀里，回头还隔几重湖。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66827,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"绝句五首 其三","author":"梅尧臣","text":"夜欲三更饥鼠斗，灯残一点小星红。\n村边坎坎赛神鼓，船底怦怦驾浪风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66828,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"绝句五首 其二","author":"梅尧臣","text":"岸边稚子戏把钓，蚯蚓作饵青条长。\n上去下来船不定，自飞自语燕争忙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66829,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"绝句五首 其一","author":"梅尧臣","text":"风过巳午未肯止，酒病婴我心无憀。\n船头拍翅野鸭浴，水上摆子狞鱼跳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66830,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"茶磨二首 其二","author":"梅尧臣","text":"盆是荷花磨是莲，谁砻麻石洞中天。\n欲将雀舌成云末，三尺蛮童一臂旋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66831,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送仲和师归雪窦兼简颖禅师","author":"梅尧臣","text":"野钵归松下，将亲闻道师。\n风沙不堪寄，霜笴自相宜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66832,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送刘纠曹","author":"梅尧臣","text":"溪边前日君辞我，江上今朝我送君。\n自去芦洲寄消息，故人犹在武昌军。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66833,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送红梅行之有诗和依其韵和","author":"梅尧臣","text":"缀缀红梅肥似蜡，濛濛飞雨洒如脂。\n吴郎齿软食不得，翻忆张公大谷梨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66834,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送张生还和州","author":"梅尧臣","text":"山头孤石望来久，天外行人今独归。\n药囊自有留生术，不管淮南木叶飞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66835,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送邹秀才游浙","author":"梅尧臣","text":"鞍傍带剑鱼皮鞘，马后携童越葛衫。\n度水缘山君底急，区区为答古千岩。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66836,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送叔昭上人附施屯田还宣城","author":"梅尧臣","text":"瓶巾过江去，远托故人船。\n借问风涛势，何如杯度年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66837,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送林大年殿丞登第倅和州","author":"梅尧臣","text":"和靖先生负美才，族孙今似汉庭枚。\n败亡项籍江边庙，应愧文场战胜来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66838,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送黄生","author":"梅尧臣","text":"我本东西南北人，穷途不复泪沾巾。\n亦知车马有行色，为见长沮与问津。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66839,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"重过南园","author":"梅尧臣","text":"谁作此园为宴喜，而今乐事已难并。\n佳人去后门长锁，蔓草离离上古城。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66840,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"重答和永叔","author":"梅尧臣","text":"我家唯有一团月，挂在飕飕草屋东。\n玉兔已为公取玩，更休窥望桂丛中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66841,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闻莺","author":"梅尧臣","text":"最好声音最好听，似调歌舌更叮咛。\n高枝抛过低枝立，金羽脩眉墨染翎。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66842,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闻禽","author":"梅尧臣","text":"禽鸣脱破裤，定无新易故。\n此语莫相讥，善贫知有素。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66843,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"倡妪叹","author":"梅尧臣","text":"万钱买尔身，千钱买尔笑。\n老笑空媚人，笑死人不要。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66844,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夏园","author":"梅尧臣","text":"夏园甘果熟，日觉树林稀。\n休笑道傍李，无人摘自肥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66845,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"留别李君君颇有归意而未遂","author":"梅尧臣","text":"酌我樽中酒，知君羡北归。\n如何沙上鸟，远逐片帆飞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66846,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"真上人因送毛令伤足复伤冷 其二","author":"梅尧臣","text":"闻道山中出入稀，偶来溪上笑谈微。\n野云不管田袍薄，寒逼瘦肤相伴归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66847,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"真上人因送毛令伤足复伤冷 其一","author":"梅尧臣","text":"陶令归时远公送，石苔秋雨步迟迟。\n凌霄花在古松上，也笑向人人不知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66848,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"莺","author":"梅尧臣","text":"桑间小妇好声音，映叶穿枝意已深。\n尽日呼郎郎不应，萧萧风雨到前林。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66849,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"逢谢师直","author":"梅尧臣","text":"昔岁南阳道中别，今向华亭水上逢。\n把酒语君悲且喜，流光冉冉去无踪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66850,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"钱志道推官遗纱帽","author":"梅尧臣","text":"远赠乌纱帽，能无白也诗。\n山花不更插，野客莫惊窥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66851,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"铁獭","author":"梅尧臣","text":"朝乘铁獭上青山，最滑春苔乱石间。\n出入白云胜蜡屐，玉骢虽贵未应闲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66852,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"陶者","author":"梅尧臣","text":"陶尽门前土，屋上无片瓦。\n十指不沾泥，鳞鳞居大厦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66853,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"啄木","author":"梅尧臣","text":"中园啄尽蠹，未肯出林飞。\n不识黄金弹，双翎坠落晖。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66854,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"啄木二首 其二","author":"梅尧臣","text":"食蠹非嫌蠹，声来古木高。\n谁将琵琶弄，写入相思槽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66855,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄天台梵才上人","author":"梅尧臣","text":"常观月从东海出，想照石桥旁畔人。\n试问当年与今日，清光不改只如新。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66856,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄宣州可真上人","author":"梅尧臣","text":"昭亭山色无纤尘，昭亭潭水见游鳞。\n长松碧筱入古寺，石上高僧度几春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66857,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄渭州刘太保求市堪乘稳駃马","author":"梅尧臣","text":"有马齿加疲且劣，欲求中驷问将军。\n为言身老趋朝熟，只要驯良不挠群。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66858,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"得山雨","author":"梅尧臣","text":"急雨射苍壁，溅林跳万珠。\n山根水壅壑，漫窍若注壶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66859,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"得沙苑榅桲戏酬","author":"梅尧臣","text":"蒺藜已枯天马归，嫩蜡笼黄霜冒干。\n不比江南楂柚酸，橐驼载与吴人看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66860,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"惜春三首 其三","author":"梅尧臣","text":"春色斗空花亦休，绿园深锁更谁游。\n残枝遗萼不中看，暮雨霏霏起暗愁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66861,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"惜春三首 其二","author":"梅尧臣","text":"前日看花心未足，狂风暴雨忽无凭。\n此身不及深溪水，随得残红出武陵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66862,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"惜春三首 其一","author":"梅尧臣","text":"九十日春无几日，不堪风雨竞吹花。\n舞英逐水向何处，泛泛斜溪伴晚霞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66863,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"晚得菖蒲","author":"梅尧臣","text":"薄暮得菖蒲，犹胜竟日无。\n我焉能免俗，三揖向樽壶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66864,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"桫椤树","author":"梅尧臣","text":"桫椤古树常占岁，在昔曾看北海碑。\n今日四方俱大稔，不知荣悴向何枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66865,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梦同诸公饯仲文梦中坐上作","author":"梅尧臣","text":"已许郊间陈祖席，少停车马莫催行。\n刘郎休恨三千里，樽酒十分听我倾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66866,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梦过三陵","author":"梅尧臣","text":"梦过汉陵间，秋风石马閒。\n当年侍臣泪，泣尽向三山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66867,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"淮阴","author":"梅尧臣","text":"天下滔滔久厌秦，英雄蛇鼠窜荆榛。\n少年豪横知多少，不及沙头一妇人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66868,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"淮雨","author":"梅尧臣","text":"雨脚射淮鸣万镞，跳点起沤鱼乱目。\n湿帆远远来未收，云漏斜阳生半幅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66869,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"隐静山怀贤师自持柏栽二十本种于会庆堂","author":"梅尧臣","text":"新作斋堂祠画像，又兴高阁秘天踪。\n今朝还藉君移柏，昨日已因鹅种松。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66870,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"隐静遗枇杷","author":"梅尧臣","text":"五月枇杷实，青青味尚酸。\n猕猴定撩乱，欲待热应难。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66871,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"黄莺 其二","author":"梅尧臣","text":"西邻少年今出游，东家女儿未识羞。\n门前乌臼叶已暗，日暮问谁墙上头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66872,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"黄莺 其一","author":"梅尧臣","text":"内家初上翠微宫，树里窥人在半空。\n笑语渐高无约束，侍臣偷望向云中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66873,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"就野人买兔","author":"梅尧臣","text":"霜浓草白兔初肥，苍鹘调拳猎犬携。\n剩付钱刀买庖餗，不须缘径更求蹄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66874,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游元紫芝琴堂","author":"梅尧臣","text":"访古历荒城，城孤落日鸣。\n人琴两不见，破月高台倾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66875,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"琴高鱼和公仪","author":"梅尧臣","text":"大鱼人骑上天去，留得小鳞来按觞。\n吾物吾乡不须念，太官常膳有肥羊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66876,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"登扬州北门","author":"梅尧臣","text":"楼上山如淡墨画，城中水似轻蓝挼。\n扬州今似刀州景，似听中和乐职歌。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66877,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"答再和","author":"梅尧臣","text":"舟行才及二三里，已复浅流如冻河。\n君有短书谁远寄，时因燕子拂樯过。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66878,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"答杜挺之遗鳅鱼乾","author":"梅尧臣","text":"百年蠹柳根半浮，揭屋颠风吹欲倒。\n寸步泥深登岸难，鳅乾助饮邻船老。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66879,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"遇画工来嵩","author":"梅尧臣","text":"朝来又入扬州郭，千万中人识者谁。\n唯有来嵩曾画我，依稀见似昔年时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66880,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"道中谢晏相公寄酒","author":"梅尧臣","text":"赪泥墨印几壶醁，将慰穷途阮步兵。\n一夜临流对明月，举杯愁听雁来声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66881,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"献甫过","author":"梅尧臣","text":"几树桃花夹竹开，阮家闾巷长春苔。\n启扉索马送客出，忽觉青红入眼来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66882,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"禁中瑞竹同本异茎","author":"梅尧臣","text":"孤竹二君子，圣人知独清。\n但将奇节并，何用首阳名。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66883,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雍丘逢钱寺丞载阳","author":"梅尧臣","text":"殷勤魏公子，落莫吴王孙。\n下客独垂泪，伤心思旧恩。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66884,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"嘉雪应祈呈权郡通判","author":"梅尧臣","text":"腊近冬残云未合，江南青垄麦休肥。\n谁将太守随车雨，一夜从风作雪飞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66885,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"漫书","author":"梅尧臣","text":"蒲葵两钱扇，漫写未嫌轻。\n老媪持将去，无端色不平。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66886,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"醉中和王平甫","author":"梅尧臣","text":"王瓜未赤方牵蔓，李子才青已近樽。\n我最年高杂年少，风流还有杜陵孙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66887,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠月上人弹琴","author":"梅尧臣","text":"人闲溪上横刳木，素琴寒倚一枝玉。\n吴王城畔锁深房，月下空弹孤雁曲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66888,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠刘谋閤副","author":"梅尧臣","text":"声名赫赫在穷塞，眉宇堂堂真丈夫。\n腰剑臂弓轻赴敌，无人不伏魏黄须。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":66889,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}}]